text = "A file will be available for download.
It contains some text; you need to count the number of words.
Multiply that number by X, then use only the first Y digits of the result.

Where X and Y are numbers you need to find. Where?
The safe doesn’t want anyone to know.
But I can give you a hint! The number X is written in red. And the number Y is also written in red, but in the form of a fairly easy math problem. And I know the problem isn’t random ;)"
